flowchart TB
  Start[Browser starts] --> Load[Read localStorage V5]
  Load --> Found{Current state found?}
  Found -- Yes --> Normalize[Normalize current workspaces]
  Found -- No --> Legacy[Try legacy V3 / legacy shape]
  Legacy --> Migrate[Migrate to workspace schema V5]
  Normalize --> Ready[Render landing or active workspace]
  Migrate --> Save[Save normalized V5 state]
  Save --> Ready
  Ready --> Form[User records expense]
  Form --> Validate[Normalize and validate fields]
  Validate --> Persist[Append expense and save localStorage]
  Persist --> Filter[Apply search, month and category filters]
  Filter --> Engine[computeSettlement]
  Engine --> Result[Paid, owed, net and transfers]
  Result --> Render[Ledger, KPIs, charts, balances and settlement]
  Filter --> CSV[CSV exports filtered rows]
  Ready --> JSON[JSON backup exports full active workspace]
  JSON --> Import[Browser FileReader import]
  Import --> NormalizeImport[Normalize as a new workspace with a new ID]
  NormalizeImport --> Persist